{"repositoryId":1403067652,"availability":"available","full":"Aayush-np/bhoomi-infratech","name":"bhoomi-infratech","description":"Production-grade construction company website with custom admin CMS — vanilla JS + Supabase (PostgreSQL RLS) + Netlify","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-03T11:29:20Z","updated":"2026-10-17T18:01:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bhoomiinfratech.netlify.app","topics":["admin-dashboard","cms","construction","netlify","postgresql","row-level-security","security","supabase","vanilla-javascript"],"demo":"https://bhoomiinfratech.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:45.865Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:45.865Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T15:44:45.865Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T15:44:45.865Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Civil Construction · Infrastructure · Real Estate","A production-grade, fully data-driven company website with a custom admin CMS, PostgreSQL backend and hardened security — built from scratch, no frameworks.","Complete web platform for a construction & infrastructure company — marketing site + private admin console, powered by Supabase (PostgreSQL with row-level security) and deployed as a static site on Netlify. Every section of the public site (projects, services, gallery, news, testimonials, company profile, contact) is rendered live from the database; the admin console manages it all — no code edits needed to change content. If the backend is unreachable, the site gracefully falls back to built-in content so it can never go blank."],"features":["Animated hero with rotating photo stack, scramble text, magnetic buttons","Live-rendered portfolio (featured stack + filterable field register)","Service detail cards, project modals with spec sheets & progress bars","News dispatches + announcements, testimonial slider, masonry ga